.env

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/

.DS_Store

# The pipeline's working files: tracks baked or fetched into pipeline/data/,
# and the ESM scorer's environment. The other bakes' environments, caches and
# checkpoints are ignored by the .gitignore beside each of them.
pipeline/data/
.esm-venv/

# The Modal client's environment, made to deploy the resolver
# (pipeline/resolver/README.md).
.modal-venv/

# The environment the resolver's worker runs in on the dev Mac, until Modal
# runs it (pipeline/resolver/README.md).
.worker-venv/

# The de novo model: its fetched corpus, its runs and its checkpoints.
# Offline working files, like pipeline/data/ above -- never committed.
# Its provenance is the exception: a kilobyte naming the UniProt release and
# the queries the committed numbers came from, which no later fetch can
# recover once that release ages out. The corpus itself rebuilds from it.
pipeline/denovo/data/*
!pipeline/denovo/data/provenance.json
pipeline/denovo/runs/
*.pt
